<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 408 0 R
/E (Mindspace is a space where you can simply be, without the pressure to achieve anything. It's a supportive community where you can prioritize your mental well-being, connect with others, and explore new strategies for reducing stress and promoting emotional regulation and resilience. Whether you're struggling with anxiety, feeling overwhelmed, or just need a break from the demands of daily life, Mindspace is a safe and welcoming space where you can take a step back and focus on yourself.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
