/E (The voice of Mindspace should be friendly, approachable, and relatable. As a student-led club,  we want to communicate in a way that feels authentic and natural to our peers. Use language that is easy to understand and avoid using jargon or overly technical terms.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [0]
>>
