539 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (When communicating with your users \(students\), it's important to speak to their needs and concerns. Acknowledge the challenges that they may be facing and offer practical solutions and resources to help them manage stress and prioritize their mental well-being. Share tips, tools, and personal stories that demonstrate the benefits of mindfulness and creating space.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
540 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
/E (When communicating on towards corporate and potential partners, it's important to speak to the value of mindfulness and mental well-being in the context of academic and career success and productivity. Use language that is professional and data-driven to demonstrate the tangible benefits of mindfulness for academic and professional performance. )
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
541 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 409 0 R
