<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 411 0 R
/E (In the midst of academic demands and stress, it's easy to neglect our own mental and emotional well-being. But here's a reminder: you have the power to create and maintain a healthy and supportive space for yourself, both internally and externally. It starts with being mindful and intentional about your own needs, emotions, and limitations, and taking active steps to prioritize self-care and well-being. At Mindspace, we believe that mental wellbeing is key to academic success and personal fulfillment. Join our community to learn evidence-based tools and strategies for reducing stress, improving focus and cognitive function, and promoting emotional regulation and resilience. #mindfulness #selfcare #mentalwellbeing #mindspaceclub #mindingmyspace)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
